Yes I realize that its only been four days since I posted this response, but
PLEASE, look to your neighboring machines before you put a request out
world-wide. It would save a lot of grief for everybody if your SA made
inquiries for you. In the case that you don't have an SA, ask an SA of a
neighboring site. I'm sure that they would try to help you in your quest.

With regards to setting up a anonimous uucp login, I am sorry, my machine
only dials out, but even if it dialed in, I wouldn't do it. It would be the
weakest link in my system's security. I know that this is a pain for some,
but I am sure that ONE of the backbones out there archives the net for a
month or so... So ask them. Just send a request with the proper amount of
respect to the root of any of the backnones, and I'm sure that that machine
will respond to your request(but no guarentee of an affermitive action).

